reen, red and infrared emitters</dt><dd><span class="flex items-baseline gap-1.5"><span data-count="7" data-decimals="0" class="font-display text-[clamp(2.6rem,5vw,4.5rem)] leading-none tabular-nums text-ink">7</span><span class="text-base font-semibold text-ink/45 sm:text-lg">LEDs</span></span><span aria-hidden="true" class="mt-3 block text-[13px] leading-relaxed text-ink/55">Green, red and infrared emitters</span></dd></div><div data-reveal="true"><dt class="sr-only">Peak optical sampling rate</dt><dd><span class="flex items-baseline gap-1.5"><span data-count="256" data-decimals="0" class="font-display text-[clamp(2.6rem,5vw,4.5rem)] leading-none tabular-nums text-ink">256</span><span class="text-base font-semibold text-ink/45 sm:text-lg">Hz</span></span><span aria-hidden="true" class="mt-3 block text-[13px] leading-relaxed text-ink/55">Peak optical sampling rate</span></dd></div><div data-reveal="true"><dt class="sr-only">Skin temperature resolution</dt><dd><span class="flex items-baseline gap-1.5"><span data-count="0.01" data-decimals="2" class="font-display text-[clamp(2.6rem,5vw,4.5rem)] leading-none tabular-nums text-ink">0.01</span><span class="text-base font-semibold text-ink/45 sm:text-lg">°C</span></span><span aria-hidden="true" class="mt-3 block text-[13px] leading-relaxed text-ink/55">Skin temperature resolution</span></dd></div><div data-reveal="true"><dt class="sr-only">Core thickness, titanium shell</dt><dd><span class="flex items-baseline gap-1.5"><span data-count="8.6" data-decimals="1" class="font-display text-[clamp(2.6rem,5vw,4.5rem)] leading-none tabular-nums text-ink">8.6</span><span class="text-base font-semibold text-ink/45 sm:text-lg">mm</span></span><span aria-hidden="true" class="mt-3 block text-[13px] leading-relaxed text-ink/55">Core thickness, titanium shell</span></dd></div></dl></div></section><section id="sensors" aria-labelledby="sensors-title" class="bg-white py-24 sm:py-36"><div class="mx-auto max-w-[1440px] px-5 sm:px-8"><div cl