ass="flex-1 rounded-[4px] transition-colors duration-500" style="background:var(--signal)"></span><span class="flex-1 rounded-[4px] transition-colors duration-500" style="background:var(--signal)"></span><span class="flex-1 rounded-[4px] transition-colors duration-500" style="background:var(--signal)"></span><span class="flex-1 rounded-[4px] transition-colors duration-500" style="background:color-mix(in oklab, var(--signal) 45%, transparent)"></span><span class="flex-1 rounded-[4px] transition-colors duration-500" style="background:rgba(255, 255, 255, 0.08)"></span><span class="flex-1 rounded-[4px] transition-colors duration-500" style="background:rgba(255, 255, 255, 0.08)"></span><span class="flex-1 rounded-[4px] transition-colors duration-500" style="background:rgba(255, 255, 255, 0.08)"></span></div><p class="mt-2 text-[11px] tabular-nums text-white/45">Each cell is one day</p><dl class="mt-auto grid grid-cols-2 gap-4 border-t border-white/15 pt-6"><div><dt class="flex items-center gap-1.5 text-[11px] font-semibold uppercase tracking-[0.08em] text-white/50"><svg xmlns="http://www.w3.org/2000/svg" width="24" height="24" viewBox="0 0 24 24" fill="none" stroke="currentColor" stroke-width="2" stroke-linecap="round" stroke-linejoin="round" class="lucide lucide-battery-charging size-4" aria-hidden="true"><path d="M15 7h1a2 2 0 0 1 2 2v6a2 2 0 0 1-2 2h-2"></path><path d="M6 7H4a2 2 0 0 0-2 2v6a2 2 0 0 0 2 2h1"></path><path d="m11 7-3 5h4l-3 5"></path><line x1="22" x2="22" y1="11" y2="13"></line></svg>Fast charge</dt><dd class="mt-1 text-base font-semibold sm:text-lg">0 to 80% in 35 min</dd></div><div><dt class="text-[11px] font-semibold uppercase tracking-[0.08em] text-white/50">Continuous GPS</dt><dd class="mt-1 text-base font-semibold sm:text-lg">Up to 24 hours</dd></div></dl></div></div></div></div></section><section id="privacy" aria-labelledby="privacy-title" class="bg-white py-24 sm:py-36"><div class="mx-auto max-w-[1440px] px-5 sm:px-8"><div class="grid gap-10 sm:gap-12 lg:grid-cols-12"><div class="lg:col-span-5"><div class="@container w-full"><p data-reveal="fade" class="eyebrow flex items-center gap-3 text-ink/55"><span class="text-signal-deep">06</span><span class="h-px w-8 bg-ink/25" aria-hidden="true"></span>Data and privacy</p><h2 id="privacy-title" data-split="true" class="mt-6 font-display text-[clamp(1.75rem,9cqw,5rem)] uppercase leading-[0.92] text-ink text-balance"><span class="inline-block overflow-hidden pb-[0.1em] -mb-[0.1em] align-top"><span data-word="true" class="inline-block">Your</span></span> <span class="inline-block overflow-hidden pb-[0.1em] -mb-[0.1em] align-top"><span data-word="true" class="inline-block">body.</span></span> <span class="inline-block overflow-hidden pb-[0.1em] -mb-[0.1em] align-top"><span data-word="true" class="inline-block">Your</span></span> <span class="inline-block overflow-hidden pb-[0.1em] -mb-[0.1em] align-top"><span data-word="true" class="inline-block">data.</span></span></h2><div data-reveal="true" class="mt-6 max-w-xl text-base leading-relaxed sm:text-[17px] text-ink/60 text-pretty">The most personal data you own deserves more than a settings page. Privacy is built into the hardware, not bolted onto the app.</div></div></div><ul data-stagger="true" class="grid gap-4 sm:grid-cols-2 lg:col-span-7"><li class="rounded-[24px] bg-surface p-6 sm:p-7"><span class="inline-flex size-10 items-center justify-center rounded-full bg-white"><svg xmlns="http://www.w3.org/2000/svg" width="24" height="24" viewBox="0 0 24 24" fill="none" stroke="currentColor" stroke-width="2" stroke-linecap="round" stroke-linejoin="round" class="lucide lucide-cpu size-5 text-ink" aria-hidden="true"><rect width="16" height="16" x="4" y="4" rx="2"></rect><rect width="6" height="6" x="9" y="9" rx="1"></rect><path d="M15 2v2"></path><path d="M15 20v2"></path><path d="M2 15h2"></path><path d="M2 9h2"></path><path d="M20 15h2"></path><path d="M20 9h2"></path><path d="M9 2v2"></path><path d="M9 20v2"></path></svg></span><h3 class="mt-6 text-lg font-semibold text-ink">Processed on the band</h3><p class="mt-2 text-[15px] leading-relaxed text-ink/60">Heart rate, HRV and sleep staging run on the core itself. Raw signals never need to leave your wrist.</p></li><li class="rounded-[24px] bg-surface p-6 sm:p-7"><span class="inline-flex size-10 items-center justify-center rounded-full bg-white"><svg xmlns="http://www.w3.org/2000/svg" width="24" height="24" viewBox="0 0 24 24" fill="none" stroke="currentColor" stroke-width="2" stroke-linecap="round" stroke-linejoin="round" class="lucide lucide-lock size-5 text-ink" aria-hidden="true"><rect width="18" height="11" x="3" y="11" rx="2" ry="2"></rect><path d="M7 11V7a5 5 0 0 1 10 0v4"></path></svg></span><h3 class="mt-6 text-lg font-semibold text-ink">Encrypted end to end</h3><p class="mt-2 text-[15px] leading-relaxed text-ink/60">Data is encrypted on the band before it syncs, and stays encrypted in the app and in your optional backup.</p></li><li class="rounded-[24px] bg-surface p-6 sm:p-7"><span class="inline-flex size-10 items-center justify-center rounded-full bg-white"><svg xmlns="http://www.w3.org/2000/svg" width="24" height="24" viewBox="0 0 24 24" fill="none" stroke="currentColor" stroke-width="2" stroke-linecap="round" stroke-linejoin="round" class="lucide lucide-eye-off size-5 text-ink" aria-hidden="true"><path d="M10.733 5.076a10.744 10.744 0 0 1 11.205 6.575 1 1 0 0 1 0 .696 10.747 10.747 0 0 1-1.444 2.49"></path><path d="M14.084 14.158a3 3 0 0 1-4.242-4.242"></path><path d="M17.479 17.499a10.75 10.75 0 0 1-15.417-5.151 1 1 0 0 1 0-.696 10.75 10.75 0 0 1 4.446-5.143"></path><path d="m2 2 20 20"></path></svg></span><h3 class="mt-6 text-lg font-semibold text-ink">Never sold, never advertised</h3><p class="mt-2 text-[15px] leading-relaxed text-ink/60">No ads, no data brokers, no selling insights to insurers or employers. Not now, not later.</p></li><li class="rounded-[24px] bg-surface p-6 sm:p-7"><span class="inline-flex size-10 items-center justify-center rounded-full bg-white"><svg xmlns="http://www.w3.org/2000/svg" width="24" height="24" viewBox="0 0 24 24" fill="none" stroke="currentColor" stroke-width="2" stroke-linecap="round" stroke-linejoin="round" class="lucide lucide-download size-5 text-ink" aria-hidden="true"><path d="M21 15v4a2 2 0 0 1-2 2H5a2 2 0 0 1-2-2v-4"></path><polyline points="7 10 12 15 17 10"></polyline><line x1="12" x2="12" y1="15" y2="3"></line></svg></span><h3 class="mt-6 text-lg font-semibold text-ink">Yours to take or delete</h3><p class="mt-2 text-[15px] leading-relaxed text-ink/60">Export your full history as CSV or FIT whenever you like, or delete your account and every byte with it.</p></li></ul></div></div></section><section id="specs" aria-labelledby="specs-title" class="bg-surface py-24 sm:py-36"><div class="mx-auto max-w-[1440px] px-5 sm:px-8"><div class="@container w-full max-w-3xl"><p data-reveal="fade" class="eyebrow flex items-center gap-3 text-ink/55"><span class="text-signal-deep">07</span><span class="h-px w-8 bg-ink/25" aria-hidden="true"></span>Specifications</p><h2 id="specs-title" data-split="true" class="mt-6 font-display text-[clamp(1.75rem,9cqw,5rem)] uppercase leading-[0.92] text-ink text-balance"><span class="inline-block overflow-hidden pb-[0.1em] -mb-[0.1em] align-top"><span data-word="true" class="inline-block">Every</span></span> <span class="inline-block overflow-hidden pb-[0.1em] -mb-[0.1em] align-top"><span data-word="true" class="inline-block">detail.</span></span></h2></div><div class="grid gap-x-16 gap-y-14 md:grid-cols-2 mt-14"><div data-reveal="true"><h3 class="eyebrow border-b border-ink pb-4 text-ink">Design &amp; materials</h3><dl><div class="grid grid-cols-[minmax(0,2fr)_minmax(0,3fr)] gap-4 border-b border-line py-4 text-sm break-words sm:gap-6 sm:text-[15px]"><dt class="text-ink/55">Sensor core</dt><dd class="font-medium text-ink">Grade 5 titanium, 50.0 × 25.4 × 8.6 mm</dd></div><div class="grid grid-cols-[minmax(0,2fr)_mi