re</dt><dd class="font-medium text-ink">Digital sensor, 0.01 °C resolution</dd></div><div class="grid grid-cols-[minmax(0,2fr)_minmax(0,3fr)] gap-4 border-b border-line py-4 text-sm break-words sm:gap-6 sm:text-[15px]"><dt class="text-ink/55">Motion</dt><dd class="font-medium text-ink">6-axis inertial unit, accelerometer and gyroscope</dd></div><div class="grid grid-cols-[minmax(0,2fr)_minmax(0,3fr)] gap-4 border-b border-line py-4 text-sm break-words sm:gap-6 sm:text-[15px]"><dt class="text-ink/55">Altitude</dt><dd class="font-medium text-ink">Barometric altimeter</dd></div><div class="grid grid-cols-[minmax(0,2fr)_minmax(0,3fr)] gap-4 border-b border-line py-4 text-sm break-words sm:gap-6 sm:text-[15px]"><dt class="text-ink/55">Positioning</dt><dd class="font-medium text-ink">Dual-frequency GNSS, L1 + L5</dd></div></dl></div><div data-reveal="true"><h3 class="eyebrow border-b border-ink pb-4 text-ink">Metrics</h3><dl><div class="grid grid-cols-[minmax(0,2fr)_minmax(0,3fr)] gap-4 border-b border-line py-4 text-sm break-words sm:gap-6 sm:text-[15px]"><dt class="text-ink/55">Heart</dt><dd class="font-medium text-ink">Heart rate 24/7, resting heart rate, HRV (rMSSD), zones</dd></div><div class="grid grid-cols-[minmax(0,2fr)_minmax(0,3fr)] gap-4 border-b border-line py-4 text-sm break-words sm:gap-6 sm:text-[15px]"><dt class="text-ink/55">Sleep</dt><dd class="font-medium text-ink">Stages, score, consistency, smart haptic alarm</dd></div><div class="grid grid-cols-[minmax(0,2fr)_minmax(0,3fr)] gap-4 border-b border-line py-4 text-sm break-words sm:gap-6 sm:text-[15px]"><dt class="text-ink/55">Health</dt><dd class="font-medium text-ink">Respiratory rate, blood oxygen, skin temperature deviation</dd></div><div class="grid grid-cols-[minmax(0,2fr)_minmax(0,3fr)] gap-4 border-b border-line py-4 text-sm break-words sm:gap-6 sm:text-[15px]"><dt class="text-ink/55">Readiness</dt><dd class="font-medium text-ink">Daily recovery score with contributors</dd></div><div class="grid grid-cols-[minmax(0,2fr)_minmax(0,3fr)] gap-4 border-b border-line py-4 text-sm break-words sm:gap-6 sm:text-[15px]"><dt class="text-ink/55">Training</dt><dd class="font-medium text-ink">Training load, load focus, VO2 max, recovery time</dd></div><div class="grid grid-cols-[minmax(0,2fr)_minmax(0,3fr)] gap-4 border-b border-line py-4 text-sm break-words sm:gap-6 sm:text-[15px]"><dt class="text-ink/55">Running</dt><dd class="font-medium text-ink">Pace, distance, elevation, cadence, stride length</dd></div></dl></div><div data-reveal="true"><h3 class="eyebrow border-b border-ink pb-4 text-ink">Power &amp; connectivity</h3><dl><div class="grid grid-cols-[minmax(0,2fr)_minmax(0,3fr)] gap-4 border-b border-line py-4 text-sm break-words sm:gap-6 sm:text-[15px]"><dt class="text-ink/55">Battery</dt><dd class="font-medium text-ink">Up to 10 days typical, 24 h continuous GNSS</dd></div><div class="grid grid-cols-[minmax(0,2fr)_minmax(0,3fr)] gap-4 border-b border-line py-4 text-sm break-words sm:gap-6 sm:text-[15px]"><dt class="text-ink/55">Charging</dt><dd class="font-medium text-ink">MagCharge slide-on puck, 0 to 80% in 35 min</dd></div><div class="grid grid-cols-[minmax(0,2fr)_minmax(0,3fr)] gap-4 border-b border-line py-4 text-sm break-words sm:gap-6 sm:text-[15px]"><dt class="text-ink/55">Storage</dt><dd class="font-medium text-ink">14 days of full-resolution data on the band</dd></div><div class="grid grid-cols-[minmax(0,2fr)_minmax(0,3fr)] gap-4 border-b border-line py-4 text-sm break-words sm:gap-6 sm:text-[15px]"><dt class="text-ink/55">Wireless</dt><dd class="font-medium text-ink">Bluetooth 5.3 Low Energy</dd></div><div class="grid grid-cols-[minmax(0,2fr)_minmax(0,3fr)] gap-4 border-b border-line py-4 text-sm break-words sm:gap-6 sm:text-[15px]"><dt class="text-ink/55">Water</dt><dd class="font-medium text-ink">10 ATM, pool and open-water swim tracking</dd></div><div class="grid grid-cols-[minmax(0,2fr)_minmax(0,3fr)] gap-4 border-b border-line py-4 text-sm break-words sm:gap-6 sm:text-[15px]"><dt class="text-ink/55">Compatibility</dt><dd class="font-medium text-ink">iOS 17 and Android 12 or later</dd></div></dl></div></div></div></section><section id="faq" aria-labelledby="faq-title" class="bg-white py-24 sm:py-36"><div class="mx-auto grid max-w-[1440px] gap-10 px-5 sm:gap-12 sm:px-8 lg:grid-cols-12"><div class="lg:col-span-4"><div class="@container w-full"><p data-reveal="fade" class="eyebrow flex items-center gap-3 text-ink/55"><span class="text-signal-deep">08</span><span class="h-px w-8 bg-ink/25" aria-hidden="true"></span>Questions</p><h2 id="faq-title" data-split="true" class="mt-6 font-display text-[clamp(1.75rem,9cqw,5rem)] uppercase leading-[0.92] text-ink text-balance"><span class="inline-block overflow-hidden pb-[0.1em] -mb-[0.1em] align-top"><span data-word="true" class="inline-block">How</span></span> <span class="inline-block overflow-hidden pb-[0.1em] -mb-[0.1em] align-top"><span data-word="true" class="inline-block">it</span></span> <span class="inline-block overflow-hidden pb-[0.1em] -mb-[0.1em] align-top"><span data-word="true" class="inline-block">works.</span></span></h2><div data-reveal="true" class="mt-6 max-w-xl text-base leading-relaxed sm:text-[17px] text-ink/60 text-pretty">The technical questions we hear most from athletes, coaches and sports scientists.</div></div></div><div data-reveal="true" class="lg:col-span-7 lg:col-start-6"><ul class="border-t border-line"><li class="border-b border-line"><h3><button id="_R_5a6_-button-0" type="button" aria-expanded="true" aria-controls="_R_5a6_-panel-0" class="group flex w-full items-start justify-between gap-4 py-5 text-left sm:gap-6 sm:py-6"><span class="text-lg font-semibold leading-snug text-ink sm:text-xl">How does a band without a screen measure HRV?</span><span aria-hidden="true" class="mt-0.5 inline-flex size-8 shrink-0 items-center justify-center rounded-full border transition-all duration-500 ease-out-expo rotate-45 border-ink bg-ink text-white group-hover:border-ink"><svg xmlns="http://www.w3.org/2000/svg" width="24" height="24" viewBox="0 0 24 24" fill="none" stroke="currentColor" stroke-width="2" stroke-linecap="round" stroke-linejoin="round" class="lucide lucide-plus size-4"><path d="M5 12h14"></path><path d="M12 5v14"></path></svg></span></button></h3><div id="_R_5a6_-panel-0" role="region" aria-labelledby="_R_5a6_-button-0" class="grid transition-[grid-template-rows] duration-500 ease-out-expo grid-rows-[1fr]"><div class="overflow-hidden"><p class="max-w-3xl pb-7 pr-4 text-[15px] sm:pr-12 leading-relaxed text-ink/65">During sleep, the optical array times every heartbeat to the millisecond. PACE calculates rMSSD, the variation between consecutive beats, across your deepest stretch of sleep, when motion and stress are lowest, and compares it with your own 30-day baseline.</p></div></div></li><li class="border-b border-line"><h3><button id="_R_5a6_-button-1" type="button" aria-expanded="false" aria-controls="_R_5a6_-panel-1" class="group flex w-full items-start justify-between gap-4 py-5 text-left sm:gap-6 sm:py-6"><span class="text-lg font-semibold leading-snug text-ink sm:text-xl">Do I need my phone for GPS?</span><span aria-hidden="true" class="mt-0.5 inline-flex size-8 shrink-0 items-center justify-center rounded-full border border-line transition-all duration-500 ease-out-expo group-hover:border-ink/40"><svg xmlns="http://www.w3.org/2000/svg" width="24" height="24" viewBox="0 0 24 24" fill="none" stroke="currentColor" stroke-width="2" stroke-linecap="round" stroke-linejoin="round" class="lucide lucide-plus size-4"><path d="M5 12h14"></path><path d="M12 5v14"></path></svg></span></button></h3><div id="_R_5a6_-panel-1" role="region" aria-labelledby="_R_5a6_-button-1" class="grid transition-[grid-template-rows] duration-500 ease-out-expo grid-rows-[0fr]"><div class="overflow-hidden"><p class="max-w-3xl pb-7 pr-4 text-[15px] sm:pr-12 leading-relaxed text-ink/65">No. Dual-frequency GNSS is built into the core, so runs and rides record full routes, pace and distance with your phone at home. Everything syncs the next time the app is open.</p></div></div></li><li class="border-b border-line"><h3><button id="_R_5a6_-button-2" type="button" aria-expanded="false" aria-controls="_R_5a6_-panel-2" class="group flex w-full items-start justify-between gap-4 py-5 text-left sm:gap-6 sm:py-6"><span class="text-lg font-semibold leading-snug text-ink sm:text-xl">Does skin tone or a tattoo affect accuracy?</span><span aria-hidden="true" class="mt-0.5 inline-flex size-8 shrink-0 items-center justify-center rounded-full border border-line transition-all duration-500 ease-out-expo group-hover:border-ink/40"><svg xmlns="http://www.w3.org/2000/svg" width="24" height="24" viewBox="0 0 24 24" fill="none" stroke="currentColor" stroke-width="2" stroke-linecap="round" stroke-linejoin="round" class="lucide lucide-plus size-4"><path d="M5 12h14"></path><path d="M12 5v14"></path></svg></span></button></h3><div id="_R_5a6_-panel-2" role="region" aria-labelledby="_R_5a6_-button-2" class="grid transition-[grid-template-rows] duration-500 ease-out-expo grid-rows-[0fr]"><div class="overflow-hidden"><p class="max-w-3xl pb-7 pr-4 text-[15px] sm:pr-12 leading-relaxed text-ink/65">The band adjusts LED brightness and switches between four photodiode paths in real time to keep signal quality high. Validation included every Fitzpatrick skin type. Dense tattoo ink directly under the sensor can reduce optical accuracy, so wearing the band on the other wrist usually helps.</p></div></div></li><li class="border-b border-line"><h3><button id="_R_5a6_-button-3" type="button" aria-expanded="false" aria-controls="_R_5a6_-panel-3" class="group flex w-full items-start justify-between gap-4 py-5 text-left sm:gap-6 sm:py-6"><span class="text-lg font-semibold leading-snug text-ink sm:text-xl">Where is my data processed and stored?</span><span aria-hidden="true" class="mt-0.5 inline-flex size-8 shrink-0 items-center justify-center rounded-full border border-line transition-all duration-500 ease-out-expo group-hover:border-ink/40"><svg xmlns="http://www.w3.org/2000/svg" width="24" height="24" viewBox="0 0 24 24" fill="none" stroke="currentColor" stroke-width="2" stroke-linecap="round" stroke-linejoin="round" class="lucide lucide-plus size-4"><path d="M5 12h14"></path><path d="M12 5v14"></path></svg></span></button></h3><div id="_R_5a6_-panel-3" role="region" aria-labelledby="_R_5a6_-button-3" class="grid transition-[grid-template-rows] duration-500 ease-out-expo grid-rows-[0fr]"><div class="overflow-hidden"><p class="max-w-3xl pb-7 pr-4 text-[15px] sm:pr-12 leading-relaxed text-ink/65">Heart rate, HRV and sleep staging are processed on the band itself. Data is encrypted before it leaves the band, stored encrypted in the app and backed up to your account only if you choose. You can export or permanently delete everything at any time.</p></div></div></li><li class="border-b border-line"><h3><button id="_R_5a6_-button-4" type="button" aria-expanded="false" aria-controls="_R_5a6_-panel-4" class="group flex w-full items-start justify-between gap-4 py-5 text-left sm:gap-6 sm:py-6"><span class="text-lg font-semibold leading-snug text-ink sm:text-xl">How does the band get new features?</span><span aria-hidden="true" class="mt-0.5 inline-flex size-8 shrink-0 items-center justify-center rounded-full border border-line transition-all duration-500 ease-out-expo group-hover:border-ink/40"><svg xmlns="http://www.w3.org/2000/svg" width="24" height="24" viewBox="0 0 24 24" fill="none" stroke="currentColor" stroke-width="2" stroke-linecap="round" stroke-linejoin="round" class="lucide lucide-plus size-4"><path d="M5 12h14"></path><path d="M12 5v14"></path></svg></span></button></h3><div id="_R_5a6_-panel-4" role="region" aria-labelledby="_R_5a6_-button-4" class="grid transition-[grid-template-rows] duration-500 ease-out-expo grid-rows-[0fr]"><div class="overflow-hidden"><p class="max-w-3xl pb-7 pr-4 